
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_JOINT_DEVELOPMENT_OF_FOREST_OF_LEOTA]
Joint development of Forest of Leota

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_JOINT_DEVELOPMENT_OF_FOREST_OF_LEOTA_desc]
As part of the Secret Economic Cooperation Agreement signed with Las Pegasus, we will jointly make use of the exceptional resources of the Forest of Leota, creating an outstanding model of collaboration... unless, of course, Las Pegasus doesn’t quite see it that way

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_JOINT_DEVELOPMENT_OF_FOREST_OF_LEOTA]
共同开发列奥塔森林

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_JOINT_DEVELOPMENT_OF_FOREST_OF_LEOTA_desc]
作为与洛马基签订的秘密互助协议的一部分，我们将共同利用列奥塔森林的优秀资源，创建一个经济合作的优秀样本....除非洛马基不是这么想的
